    <string name="legal_welcome_desc">Please read and agree to the following before continuing</string>
    <string name="agree_and_continue">Agree &amp; continue</string>
    <string name="terms_text">1. This is an unofficial third-party client for NetEase Cloud Music (163.com). It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NetEase.\n2. By using this app you agree to comply with all applicable laws and the terms of service of the original platform.\n3. This app is provided for personal learning and study purposes only. You are solely responsible for the consequences of your use.\n4. We may update this agreement at any time; continued use of the app constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">1. This app does NOT collect, upload, or share any of your personal information.\n2. Your login cookie is stored ONLY on this device (local storage) and is used solely to access the music API. It is never transmitted to any third party.\n3. Play history, search history, and settings are stored locally on your device.\n4. Network requests are made only to the official NetEase Cloud Music API for normal functionality (search, playback, playlists).\n5. If you uninstall the app, all local data is deleted.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">1. This is an independent third-party client and has NO cracking, unlocking, or fee-evasion functions. VIP-only songs require a legitimate account to play.\n2. All music content and copyrights belong to their respective owners (NetEase Cloud Music).\n3. This app is provided free of charge; the developer is not liable for any issues or losses caused by network, account, or other reasons.\n4. This app is for personal learning and study only. Do not use it for commercial purposes.</string>

